    "answer": {
      "short": "D. $0.3620$",
      "worked": "There are $52-12=40$ non-picture cards. Exactly one picture card can occur in either order.\n\n$$\\begin{align*}P(\\text{exactly one picture card})&=\\frac{12}{52}\\times\\frac{40}{51}+\\frac{40}{52}\\times\\frac{12}{51}\\\\&=\\frac{960}{2652}\\\\&=\\frac{80}{221}\\\\&\\approx0.3620\\end{align*}$$\nCorrect answer: D.",
      "solutionDiagrams": []
    },
